      ],
      "notes": [
        "Loopable. If you still run out of skills: Constricting Charm → Spirit Sparks (Shift+Z → LMB).",
        "Lurking Claws (S+F) can be inserted anywhere EXCEPT between Spirited Away → Petal Play, to reposition for back attacks.",
        "Shift+X and W+RMB can be moved around within the combo if needed (video).",
        "Inflexible by design — a combo tuned to the spot or the DPS priority list outperforms it (both sources)."
      ]
